@startuml "SEARCH request"
title: "/search (POST, sync): Processing external search request "
/'
Общее описание синхронной обработки FIND запроса к VM
'/
actor "СБЕР" as SB #coral
participant "VM-API" as VM #LightGreen
participant "Search Engine" as SE #LightBlue

' autonumber 10 10 "<b>[000]"

note over SB
    Пользователь СБ 
    сформировал задачу
    для поиска.
end note

SB -> VM: **""/find""**: (SYNC POST запрос)
VM -> VM: **PARSE** \norg_id; user_id; \nrequest_id; request_body; \nweb-hook URL
VM -> SE: AUGMENT
SE -> VM: AUGMENT Result
alt Ошибка при парсинге запроса
    VM -[#red]-x SB: ""**400**"": Bad Request  / \nОбогащенный вариант запроса
end alt

VM -> VM: **VALIDATE**: проверка запроса
alt Валидация не пройдена
    VM -[#red]-x SB: ""**401**"": Not Authorized \n""**403**"": Forbidden \n""**429**"": Too Many Requests
end alt

VM ->> SE ++ #10FF10: **""request_id""**: (async) Запустить поиск\nс параметрами запроса
SE -> VM: **""search_id""**    
VM -[#Green]-x SB: **""202: search_id:""** \n[Актуальный запрос]

@enduml

' -----------------------------

@startuml "Check Result"
title "/search/{search_id} (GET, async poll): Search Status & Result polling"
actor "СБЕР" as SB #coral
participant "VM-API" as VM #LightGreen
participant "Search Engine" as SE #LightBlue

' autonumber 10 10 "<b>[000]"


VM -[#Gray]> VM: ...
VM -[#Gray]> VM: **PARSE** \norg_id; user_id; \nrequest_id; request_body; \n**web-hook URL**
VM -> VM: ...

VM -[#Gray]>> SE ++ #10FF10: **""request_id""**: (async) Запустить поиск\nс параметрами запроса
note over SE
    Поисковая машина
    отрабатывает запрос
end note
SE -[#Gray]> VM: **""search_id""**    
VM -[#Green]-x SB: **""202: search_id""** / [Актуальный запрос]
loop SB Polling: Till search in progress
SB ->> VM: Get search status: ""**search_id**""
VM ->> SE: Check status: **""search_id""**
SE ->> VM: **""search_id: status & current result set""**
VM ->> SB: web-hook URL: **""200: search_id: status & current result set""**
end loop

SE ->> VM --: **""search_id: status & final result set""**
VM -[#Green]>x SB: web-hook URL: **""200: search_id: status & [Final result set]""**
@enduml


' -----------------------------

@startuml "Cancel Search"
title "/search/{search_id} (DELETE, sync): Cancel running search"
actor "СБЕР" as SB #coral
participant "VM-API" as VM #LightGreen
participant "Search Engine" as SE #LightBlue

' autonumber 10 10 "<b>[000]"

VM -[#Gray]> VM: ...
VM -[#Gray]> VM: **PARSE** \norg_id; user_id; \nrequest_id; request_body; \n**web-hook URL**
VM -> VM: ...

VM -[#Gray]>> SE ++ #10FF10: **""request_id""**: (async) Запустить поиск\nс параметрами запроса
note over SE
    Поисковая машина
    отрабатывает запрос
end note

SE -[#Gray]> VM: **""search_id""**    
VM -[#Green]-x SB: **""202: search_id""** / [Актуальный запрос]

loop SB Polling: Till search in progress or CANCEL reqeust
SB ->> VM: Send **""GET (status)""** or ""**DELETE**"": ""**search_id**""
alt GET STATUS
    VM ->> SE: Get search status: **""search_id""**
    SE ->> VM: **""search_id: status: RUNNING""** \n[Current result set]
    VM ->> SB: web-hook URL: **""200: request_id: status: RUNNING""** \n[Current result set]
else DELETE (Cancel) Request
    VM -[#red]>> SE: **CANCEL:** **""search_id""**
    SE -[#red]>> VM: **""search_id: status: CANCELLED""** \n[Current result set]
    VM -[#red]x SB: web-hook URL: **""200: search_id: status: CANCELLED""** \n[Current result set]
end alt
end loop

SE ->> VM --: **""search_id: status: DONE""** \n[Final result set]
VM -[#Green]>x SB: web-hook URL: **""200: search_id: status: DONE""** \n[Final result set]
@enduml

' -----------------------------

@startuml "Make Order"
title "/order (POST, sync): Create purchase order"
actor "СБЕР" as SB #coral
participant "VM-API" as VM #LightGreen
participant "Search Engine" as SE #LightBlue
participant "V.Market" as MP #LightGray

' autonumber 10 10 "<b>[000]"

note over SB
    Пользователь отобрал из поиска
    товары для закупки и передает
    эти товары для формирования
    заказа.
end note

SB -> VM: POST: **""search_id""**: \n[ordering items (card's data)]

VM -> MP: Create order: **""search_id""**: \n[ordering items]
MP -> VM: **""order_id""**

alt "Is order_id valid"
    VM -[#Green]x SB: **""201: order_id""**: Order created
else
    VM -[#Red]x SB: **""400: search_id""**: Can't create order
end alt

@enduml
